id=ternak_tt
name=Ternak TT — Zygisk Fresh Persona
version=v1.1.6
versionCode=1106
author=Ilham311
description=Zygisk device spoofer targeting TikTok (musically/trill/lite) + Grab Passenger. 6-layer Java hook + 78 native prop spoofs + L7 TYPED spoof tables + companion fork+setns bind mount overlay. v1.0.15: target list moved out of the binary into /data/adb/modules/ternak_tt/target.txt — the companion loads + hot-reloads it (mtime watch), so you can add/remove TikTok clones, Grab Driver, or any custom package without rebuilding. Wire protocol updated: Zygisk .so sends pkg name to companion, companion rejects non-targets with len=0 (single source of truth). CLI gains `ternak-tt targets` subcommand. L7 SPI/SPL/SPB gain SUPPRESS label for known-noise keys (log.looper.*.slow, debug.watson.*) to keep summaries readable. Auto-summarizer on Action tap now breaks SPOOF hits out by hook layer (L1/L2/L7-SPB/SPI/SPL) and counts SUPPRESS separately. v1.1.6: Path B rearchitected — lsplant now consumed as prebuilt .so from lsplant-standalone AAR on Maven Central (no more git-clone-from-source fragility). liblsplant.so + libdobby.so shipped via $MODPATH/system/lib{,64}/ overlay so DT_NEEDED resolves inside app processes at runtime (this was a latent v1.1.4 runtime bug never seen because Path B never compiled in CI before). Works on Zygisk-Next / HMA-OSS.
updateJson=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Ilham311/Tt/main/update.json
